{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a localized string key from the given string interpolation."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"stringInterpolation"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"stringInterpolation","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The string interpolation to use as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"localization key.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To create a localized string key from a string interpolation, use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\()"},{"type":"text","text":" string interpolation syntax. Swift matches the parameter"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"types in the expression to one of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"appendInterpolation"},{"type":"text","text":" methods"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalizedStringKey\/StringInterpolation"},{"type":"text","text":". The interpolated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"types can include numeric values, Foundation types, and SwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwif